===Format===
* '''Group Stage:'''
** Three double-elimination (GSL) format groups
*** Each group has 4 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Winner from each group advances to the [[BLAST/Premier/2023/Fall|Fall Final]]
** Remaining teams advance to the seeded Play-In Stage

* '''Play-In Stage:'''
** Three Single-Elimination gauntlets
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Winner from each gauntlet advances to the [[BLAST/Premier/2023/Fall|Fall Final]]
** Remaining teams advance to the [[BLAST/Premier/2023/Fall/Showdown/Europe|EU]] or [[BLAST/Premier/2023/Fall/Showdown/Americas|AM]] Fall Showdowns

