===Format===
* '''Group Stage:'''
** Four double-elimination (GSL) format groups
*** Each group has 4 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** The winning team from each group advances to the [[BLAST/Premier/2024/Fall|Fall Final]]
** The second place team proceeds to the Play-In Stage

* '''Play-In Stage:'''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** The two winning teams advance to the [[BLAST/Premier/2024/Fall|Fall Final]]

